/Type /Annot
/V (Volkan Cevher is Full Professor at EPFL and head of the Laboratory for Information and Inference Systems\056 He is an IEEE Fellow for contributions to model\055based signal processing and semi\055definite programming\054 an ELLIS Fellow\054 and recipient of ERC Starting and Consolidator Grants and multiple best\055paper awards\056)
/AP <<
/N 205 0 R
>>
>>
endobj
