/Helv 12.0 Tf 0 g
2 142.044067 Td
(Volkan Cevher is Full Professor at EPFL and head of the Laboratory for Information and Inference Systems. He is an IEEE Fellow for contributions to model-based signal processing and semi-definite programming, an ELLIS Fellow, and recipient of ERC Starting and Consolidator Grants and multiple best-paper awards.) Tj
ET
Q
EMC
Q

endstream
